"description": "CDW Corp. engages in the provision of information technology solutions to small, medium, and large business, government, education, and healthcare customers. It operates through the following segments: Commercial, Government, and Education. The Commercial segment consists of corporate, financial services, and healthcare customers in the U.S. The Government segment includes federal, state, and local agencies in the U.S. The Education segment consists of primary, secondary, and higher education institutions in the U.S. The company was founded by Michael P. Krasny in 1984 and is headquartered in Vernon Hills, IL.",
